%t A090432 Prime[#]&/@Select[Range[100],Total[IntegerDigits[Prime[#]]]-Total[IntegerDigits[#]]>0&] (* _Michel Lagneau_, Nov 07 2015 *)
%o A090432 (PARI) isok(k) = sumdigits(prime(k)) > sumdigits(k);
%o A090432 apply(prime, select(isok, [1..100])) \\ _Michel Marcus_, Nov 07 2015; corrected Oct 21 2026
